    "Si le menu n’apparaît pas, activez FileMailer dans Réglages Système > Général > Ouverture et extensions > Extensions du Finder, puis rouvrez le menu contextuel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "إذا لم تظهر القائمة، فقم بتمكين FileMailer في إعدادات النظام > عام > الفتح والملحقات > Finder Extensions، ثم أعد فتح قائمة السياق."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "যদি মেনুটি উপস্থিত না হয়, তাহলে সিস্টেম সেটিংস > সাধারণ > খোলা ও এক্সটেনশন > ফাইন্ডার এক্সটেনশনে ফাইলমেলার সক্ষম করুন, তারপর প্রসঙ্গ মেনুটি পুনরায় খুলুন।"
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si el menú no apareix, activeu FileMailer a Configuració del sistema > General > Obertura i extensions > Extensions del cercador i torneu a obrir el menú contextual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果未出现该菜单，请在“系统设置”>“常规”>“打开和扩展”>“Finder 扩展”中启用 FileMailer，然后重新打开上下文菜单。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果未出現該選單，請在「系統設定」>「一般」>「開啟和擴充」>「Finder 擴充功能」中啟用 FileMailer，然後重新開啟上下文選單。"
          }
        },
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ako se izbornik ne pojavi, omogućite FileMailer u System Settings > General > Opening & Extensions > Finder Extensions, zatim ponovno otvorite kontekstni izbornik."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pokud se nabídka nezobrazí, povolte FileMailer v System Settings > General > Opening & Extensions > Finder Extensions a poté znovu otevřete kontextovou nabídku."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvis menuen ikke vises, skal du aktivere FileMailer i Systemindstillinger > Generelt > Åbning og udvidelser > Finder-udvidelser og derefter genåbne kontekstmenuen."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als het menu niet verschijnt, schakelt u FileMailer in Systeeminstellingen > Algemeen > Openen en extensies > Finder-extensies in en opent u vervolgens het contextmenu opnieuw."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the menu does not appear, enable FileMailer in System Settings > General > Opening & Extensions > Finder Extensions, then reopen the context menu."
          }
        },
        "en-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the menu does not appear, enable FileMailer in System Settings > General > Opening & Extensions > Finder Extensions, then reopen the context menu."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the menu does not appear, enable FileMailer in System Settings > General > Opening & Extensions > Finder Extensions, then reopen the context menu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the menu does not appear, enable FileMailer in System Settings > General > Opening & Extensions > Finder Extensions, then reopen the context menu."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jos valikko ei tule näkyviin, ota FileMailer käyttöön kohdassa Järjestelmäasetukset > Yleiset > Avaaminen ja laajennukset > Finder Extensions ja avaa sitten kontekstivalikko uudelleen."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si le menu n’apparaît pas, activez FileMailer dans Réglages Système > Général > Ouverture et extensions > Extensions du Finder, puis rouvrez le menu contextuel."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn das Menü nicht angezeigt wird, aktivieren Sie FileMailer unter Systemeinstellungen > Allgemein > Öffnen & Erweiterungen > Finder-Erweiterungen und öffnen Sie dann das Kontextmenü erneut."
